  "goodToKnow": "Erniedrigen means to humiliate or degrade: jemanden öffentlich erniedrigen, erniedrigende Behandlung (degrading treatment, banned by human rights law). In music, it means to flatten a note, and in maths to lower a value. Synonyms: demütigen, herabwürdigen. From niedrig (low). Not separable: erniedrigte, hat erniedrigt."
